---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+13015550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(301) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Deck Board Replacement Gaithersburg MD | Wood & Composite" description="Replace damaged, rotten, or warped deck boards with matching materials. Fast, clean work for wood and composite decks across Montgomery County.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Deck Board Replacement in Gaithersburg, MD</h1>
      <p>Replace damaged, rotten, or warped deck boards with matching materials. Fast, clean work for wood and composite decks across Montgomery County.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1.25rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Get a Quote — {phoneDisplay}</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-page">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose">
<h2>Individual or Section Board Replacement</h2>
<p>Soft spots, cracks, and warping are common after years of Maryland weather. We remove damaged boards and install new ones that match your existing deck as closely as possible — whether pressure-treated, cedar, or composite.</p>
<h3>What We Handle</h3>
<ul>
<li>Single-board swaps and multi-board sections</li>
<li>Fascia and stair tread replacement</li>
<li>Hidden-fastener systems when appropriate</li>
<li>Color and grain matching guidance</li>
</ul>
<h3>Why Replace Boards Promptly</h3>
<p>A soft board is a trip and fall hazard. Left alone, moisture continues to travel into adjacent boards and framing. Addressing the problem early keeps the rest of the deck healthy longer.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:2rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Schedule Deck Board Replacement in Gaithersburg, MD</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
